{"id":"lyubezno","lemma":"любезно","pos":"adv","rank":2631,"glosses":["friendly (in a friendly manner)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/ba/Ru-%D0%BB%D1%8E%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BB%D1%8E%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он любезно ответил на вопросы.","en":"He kindly answered questions.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to answer, to reply","l":"ответить"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"question","l":"вопрос"}]},{"text":"Это очень любезно с вашей стороны.","en":"It's very kind of you.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},{"g":"side, hand, party","l":"сторона"}]},{"text":"Том любезно ответил на все мои вопросы.","en":"Tom kindly answered all my questions.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to answer, to reply","l":"ответить"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"question","l":"вопрос"}]},{"text":"Она любезно показала мне дорогу.","en":"She kindly showed me the way.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"to show","l":"показать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Она любезно подвезла меня до дома.","en":"She kindly gave me a ride home.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"to bring","l":"подвезти"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"until / before"},{"g":"at home"}]}]}